  "prefLabel": "Ec-Wtr 103.01 Office Hours, Electronic Mail Address, and Location",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ec-Wtr 103.01 Office Hours, Electronic Mail Address, and Location.\n\n(a) The council’s office is located at:\n\nDepartment of Environmental Services\n\n29 Hazen Drive\n\nP.O. Box 95\n\nConcord, NH 03302-0095\n\n(b) The council’s electronic email address is appeals@des.nh.gov.\n\n(c) The council’s regular business hours shall coincide with those of the department.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ec-Wtr 100) #13923, eff 4-11-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ec-wtr100.html"
